
1) In root composer.json file

  "repositories": [
        {
            "type": "composer",
            "url": "https://packages.drupal.org/8"
        },
	   	{
		  "type": "path",
		  "url": "recipes/my_custom_recipe"
		}
    ],
	
2. install composer
composer require my/my_custom_recipe:dev-main

3. Apply recipe
vendor/bin/drush recipe ../recipes/my_custom_recipe

4. default content export-
vendor/bin/drush   default-content-export  node 1
https://www.drush.org/13.x/commands/content_export/
https://www.drupal.org/project/default_content

5. Place in content folder 